00:36:50.000 --> 00:37:11.000
and the police kind of cracking heads and stuff. And as darkness falls, there is a very tense atmosphere. There's a change over in the police shift. So a new load of police arrive and they are told by their departing comrades, it's all going to kick off this evening. You know, you've got to be ready to crack some heads. and they are told by their departing comrades, it's all going to kick off this evening. You know, you've got to be ready to crack some heads. Allen Ginsberg starts chanting, BOM again.

