00:41:42.000 --> 00:42:05.000
house. With bunny girls. Yeah. Whack him. I mean, you'd be mad not to. So Tuesday, the 27th of August is Lyndon Johnson's birthday. He's celebrating it in Texas, but I think there's a part of him, a considerable part of him that is hoping to get a call from Mayor Daley saying they've come to their senses, they're going to nominate you and of course they're not. Would he have accepted do you think?

